usion. Focused tests, race tests, parser/publication tests and vet passed independently.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"validate\",\n      \"component\": \"pose-mcp\",\n      \"disposition\": \"passed\",\n      \"evidence\": \"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Passed disposition cites the supplied sealed component validation. Independently invoked pose validate --strict --module pose-mcp; that full rerun had not completed at conclusion. Its existing green evidence does not cover the newly identified start-state routes.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"}}
